meta {
  name: 05 Search
  seq: 5
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Hybrid search (control API, search policy): the query is embedded with Titan, nearest vectors
  and keyword matches are fused, one tenant at a time. The caller must read (or write) a source of
  that tenant (producer `source_access`). Uses `tenantId` from the environment.
}
